WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.628
Bar drifting forward. Get a heads-up.

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:06.411
You filmed your reps today. Now your heavy single is next.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:10.861
When the bar drifts further forward, a short note says so.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.108
Prefer no note. Switch it off in Settings, under Training.

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:20.211
Barforge Weightlifting is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
